# Owner review for CI/CD, release tooling, delivery, the installer, the security layer and the
# checks that gate them. The main branch ruleset declared in .github/expected-settings.json
# requires code owner review (with one approval and approval of the last push), so a change to any
# path below needs the owner's approval. GitHub enforces the ruleset; this file only names the
# owners. The maintainers' read-only drift check (docs/ci-security.md, "Repository settings")
# reports when the live rules differ from the declared ones.
